WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
It's over. I've never participated in the selection.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,800
My ability to survive till now is all due to my own ability.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,600
But how can this be considered useless?

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,200
Since you don't want to be decent

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,200
Then let me help you experience it

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,200
Uncle Zhao roll call

7
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:18,240
Wang Zhu, what were you thinking about when you gave up the stick?

8
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,640
I want to run now

9
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,840
I still dare to run

10
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:25,350
Litou Sun Daniu

11
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:27,380
Chen Laosan Ma Dali

12
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,380
Gao Dachun Sun Tietou

13
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:33,380
Uncle Zhao, there is another person who wants me to have some, okay?

14
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:36,220
Come on

15
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:40,460
Come out proactively, Sister Zhou

16
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:45,440
You are a gangster and a private vendetta

17
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,440
Mr. Lin, let me help you

18
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:49,440
Zhou Mei has never made a choice since joining the team

19
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:51,440
She makes a contribution

20
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,640
I don't think anyone has one.

21
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:57,330
None

22
00:00:57,330 --> 00:00:59,240
Why

23
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:09,300
Have you been waiting for this day for a long time?

24
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:10,990
never plan

25
00:01:10,990 --> 00:01:13,950
Those who have been taught the truth should take the initiative to come out.

26
00:01:13,950 --> 00:01:15,950
This will save you pain
